sequenceDiagram
    actor Client
    participant AuthorResource
    participant AuthorService
    participant PostgreSQL
    
    Note over Client,PostgreSQL: Update Author REST API Flow
    
    Client->>AuthorResource: PUT /authors/{id} with Author body
    Note right of Client: id: Long (author identifier) author: Author (updated Author object)
    
    activate AuthorResource
    Note over AuthorResource: Client sends PUT /authors/{id} with Author body
    
    AuthorResource->>AuthorResource: update(author, id)
    Note over AuthorResource: AuthorResource.update(obj, id) invoked
    
    AuthorResource->>AuthorResource: author.setId(id)
    Note over AuthorResource: Author ID set from path variable
    
    AuthorResource->>AuthorService: update(author)
    Note over AuthorService: AuthorService.update(obj) called
    
    activate AuthorService
    AuthorService->>PostgreSQL: UPDATE author SET name = ?, email = ? WHERE id = ?
    Note over PostgreSQL: Author updated in database
    
    activate PostgreSQL
    PostgreSQL-->>AuthorService: return update count
    deactivate PostgreSQL
    
    AuthorService-->>AuthorResource: return void
    deactivate AuthorService
    
    AuthorResource-->>Client: ResponseEntity.noContent().build()
    Note right of AuthorResource: ResponseEntity with 204 No Content returned
    
    deactivate AuthorResource